# One line ending everywhere. backup/pitr.sh is run by bash inside CI and inside
# a Linux container; a CR at the end of a shebang line is a startup failure that
# only appears on the machine that is not the author's.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary

# Исключение: батники Windows без CRLF не запускаются.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# Бинарные: не сравниваются построчно и не трогаются конвертацией.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.bz2 binary
